"## [plants](/api-reference/plants)

| Endpoint | Method | Path | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [List plants](/api-reference/plants/list-plants) | \`GET\` | \`/plants\` | Returns all plants in the garden. |
| [Create plant](/api-reference/plants/create-plant) *(Beta)* | \`POST\` | \`/plants\` | Adds a plant to the garden. |
| [Delete plant](/api-reference/plants/delete-plant) *(Deprecated)* | \`DELETE\` | \`/plants/{plantId}\` | Removes a plant. |

## [users](/api-reference/users)

| Endpoint | Method | Path | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [List users](/api-reference/users/list-users) | \`GET\` | \`/users\` | Lists every gardener with access to the garden. |

## [store](/api-reference/store)

| Endpoint | Method | Path | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [Create order](/api-reference/store/create-order) | \`POST\` | \`/store/orders\` | Places an order for seeds. |
"
`;

exports[`endpoint-index-pages > flag on > keeps a manual summary and appends the endpoint list > plants-section 1`] = `
"# Plants

Manage the plants in your garden.

## Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Path | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [List plants](/api-reference/plants/list-plants) | \`GET\` | \`/plants\` | Returns all plants in the garden. |
| [Create plant](/api-reference/plants/create-plant) *(Beta)* | \`POST\` | \`/plants\` | Adds a plant to the garden. |
| [Delete plant](/api-reference/plants/delete-plant) *(Deprecated)* | \`DELETE\` | \`/plants/{plantId}\` | Removes a plant. |
"
`;

exports[`endpoint-index-pages > tag description pages > keeps the tag description and appends the endpoint list > store-tag-description 1`] = `
